1
00:00:03,570 --> 00:00:04,570
(Episode 11)

2
00:00:04,570 --> 00:00:05,600
It was you.

3
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:09,070
You tampered with the medicine,

4
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:11,410
and that's why Mi Young had a miscarriage.

5
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:14,710
Won Ho.

6
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:16,480
Why?

7
00:00:17,950 --> 00:00:19,080
Tell me why!

8
00:00:23,490 --> 00:00:24,490
Won Ho.

9
00:00:28,630 --> 00:00:29,760
You really don't know...

10
00:00:32,030 --> 00:00:33,700
my true feelings?

11
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:34,800
Speak up, you bastard.

12
00:00:35,870 --> 00:00:38,300
Tell me why you did that to Mi Young!

13
00:00:40,770 --> 00:00:41,910
The one I have feelings for...

14
00:00:44,270 --> 00:00:45,580
is not Mi Young.

15
00:00:47,540 --> 00:00:48,550
It's...

16
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:53,780
It's you

17
00:00:56,990 --> 00:00:57,990
You...

18
00:01:00,720 --> 00:01:02,130
Do not tell me...

19
00:01:02,630 --> 00:01:03,760
Kang Kyung Tae...

20
00:01:05,700 --> 00:01:07,330
had feelings for CEO Ji.

21
00:01:09,670 --> 00:01:11,570
That is why he pushed me off the cliff.

22
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:18,940
You know it too.

23
00:01:21,950 --> 00:01:23,580
You know what you mean to me.

24
00:01:30,390 --> 00:01:32,460
You are not listening to me? Hey.

25
00:01:33,890 --> 00:01:36,530
How much do I have to hit you, you little brat?

26
00:01:41,500 --> 00:01:43,230
Hey, Kang Kyung Tae.

27
00:01:43,300 --> 00:01:46,200
If I catch you drawing this garbage one more time,

28
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:48,200
we are both dead.

29
00:01:49,940 --> 00:01:51,680
Do you want to follow your mother?

30
00:01:53,780 --> 00:01:55,180
You little punk.

31
00:01:56,850 --> 00:01:59,980
Hey, how much more do I have to hit you?

32
00:02:01,080 --> 00:02:03,090
Why do you never listen?

33
00:02:04,190 --> 00:02:05,460
Get up, you brat.

34
00:02:11,860 --> 00:02:12,860
Mom.

35
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:15,600
I am sorry.

36
00:02:17,370 --> 00:02:19,440
I do not think I can hold on anymore.

37
00:02:24,470 --> 00:02:25,610
What are you doing right now?

38
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:28,650
- What are you doing right now? - Let go of me.

39
00:02:28,710 --> 00:02:32,020
- I said let go of me! - No. You cannot do this.

40
00:02:35,590 --> 00:02:36,650
Are you crazy?

41
00:02:38,660 --> 00:02:40,920
What happened? Your face...

42
00:02:42,030 --> 00:02:43,160
Hey, take this.

43
00:02:50,700 --> 00:02:51,940
I said, take this.

44
00:02:59,180 --> 00:03:02,710
I had a really hard time when my father passed away.

45
00:03:03,980 --> 00:03:06,220
But I got through it by drawing.

46
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:08,990
I thought I would never be okay,

47
00:03:09,090 --> 00:03:12,260
but as I kept drawing, I eventually felt better.

48
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:22,000
This is my lucky charm, but I will give it to you.

49
00:03:23,570 --> 00:03:25,400
Why are you giving me this?

50
00:03:25,470 --> 00:03:26,540
Just follow me.

51
00:03:31,810 --> 00:03:35,910
You were a ray of light...

52
00:03:36,010 --> 00:03:37,410
in my dark life.

53
00:03:38,620 --> 00:03:40,050
I never had to wander alone...

54
00:03:41,950 --> 00:03:43,650
or get lost...

55
00:03:45,260 --> 00:03:46,420
and stray from my path.

56
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:48,890
There are so many pretty things.

57
00:03:52,730 --> 00:03:54,900
What do you think it would be like to live in this neighbourhood?

58
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:56,300
Why do you ask all of a sudden?

59
00:03:56,370 --> 00:03:58,500
Well, later when Mi Young has the baby,

60
00:03:58,540 --> 00:04:01,940
it'd be nice for the three of us to live here in Milan.

61
00:04:02,010 --> 00:04:06,540
- Live in Milan permanently? - Not right now, but later.

62
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:09,880
Mi Young can finish her studies,

63
00:04:09,950 --> 00:04:12,180
and I can make dresses while watching the baby.

64
00:04:12,950 --> 00:04:14,680
Does it not make you happy just imagining it?

65
00:04:17,820 --> 00:04:19,490
Oh, this is nice.

66
00:04:21,990 --> 00:04:22,990
Hello.

67
00:04:24,830 --> 00:04:26,130
I was sad.

68
00:04:26,630 --> 00:04:28,430
My drawings are all about you,

69
00:04:29,700 --> 00:04:31,430
but I am nowhere to be found in yours.

70
00:04:33,100 --> 00:04:36,170
I thought of you as more than family,

71
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:37,370
but to you, I...

72
00:04:39,640 --> 00:04:42,210
was actually nothing.

73
00:04:42,280 --> 00:04:43,750
So...

74
00:04:43,780 --> 00:04:45,050
So what did you do?

75
00:04:47,420 --> 00:04:50,720
What on earth did you do to Mi Young's medicine?

76
00:04:50,820 --> 00:04:52,390
I had to do something back then.

77
00:04:53,760 --> 00:04:57,360
I had to stop your picture...

78
00:04:59,030 --> 00:05:00,100
from being completed, no matter what.

79
00:05:04,800 --> 00:05:07,640
(Herbal medicine pregnant women should avoid)

80
00:05:09,940 --> 00:05:12,010
(Mokdanpi: Risk of miscarriage, avoid during pregnancy)

81
00:05:12,940 --> 00:05:14,540
- Welcome. - Hello.

82
00:05:14,610 --> 00:05:17,250
Do you happen to have this?

83
00:05:18,350 --> 00:05:20,550
We have mokdanpi.

84
00:05:31,430 --> 00:05:33,200
(Mokdanpi)

85
00:05:49,250 --> 00:05:50,250
Stop!

86
00:05:51,810 --> 00:05:53,350
You bastard...

87
00:05:53,420 --> 00:05:54,620
Why did you do it?

88
00:05:54,650 --> 00:05:57,250
Why did you do that to Mi Young when she did nothing wrong?

89
00:05:58,720 --> 00:05:59,790
I was scared.

90
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:03,090
I was afraid that if the baby was born,

91
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:04,290
you would change.

92
00:06:05,700 --> 00:06:06,930
I was afraid you would leave my side...

93
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:09,400
forever.

94
00:06:18,640 --> 00:06:19,640
No.

95
00:06:20,710 --> 00:06:21,810
It is all my fault.

96
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:25,280
That day 17 years ago,

97
00:06:26,650 --> 00:06:28,350
when you jumped off the bridge,

98
00:06:30,250 --> 00:06:31,820
I should not have caught you.

99
00:06:36,390 --> 00:06:37,390
Won Ho.

100
00:06:38,260 --> 00:06:39,400
I should not have...

101
00:06:41,630 --> 00:06:42,930
saved you back then.

102
00:06:46,770 --> 00:06:48,610
Do you want me to just disappear?

103
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:54,580
If I die,

104
00:06:56,580 --> 00:06:58,410
do you think you will feel better?

105
00:07:29,810 --> 00:07:30,850
CEO Ji...

106
00:07:42,230 --> 00:07:44,260
Hey!

107
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:53,600
Kyung Tae!

108
00:07:55,410 --> 00:07:57,240
Hey!

109
00:07:57,310 --> 00:08:01,210
Hey. Call 911! Quick!

110
00:08:01,280 --> 00:08:03,710
Hey, Kyung Tae.

111
00:08:03,780 --> 00:08:05,520
Hey.

112
00:08:05,580 --> 00:08:07,120
What do we do?

113
00:08:07,180 --> 00:08:09,250
Kyung Tae.

114
00:08:13,620 --> 00:08:15,790
- I will take these two. - Sure.

115
00:08:16,430 --> 00:08:18,190
You came alone today.

116
00:08:18,260 --> 00:08:19,260
Excuse me?

117
00:08:19,330 --> 00:08:21,960
Last time, your husband came with you and helped carry your bags.

118
00:08:23,270 --> 00:08:24,800
He is busy today.

119
00:08:29,940 --> 00:08:31,170
Hello.

120
00:08:31,240 --> 00:08:33,440
Mi Young, where are you right now?

121
00:08:33,510 --> 00:08:36,510
Hey, I am at the market to buy some fabric.

122
00:08:36,580 --> 00:08:38,980
Is everything okay with you?

123
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:41,580
What do you mean? Why would anything be wrong?

124
00:08:41,620 --> 00:08:43,250
As long as you are okay, that is all that matters.

125
00:08:43,350 --> 00:08:44,490
I will call you later.

126
00:08:51,260 --> 00:08:52,600
(Operating Room)

127
00:08:58,400 --> 00:09:00,170
If you are going to keep living like this,

128
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:02,470
would it not be better to just get a divorce?

129
00:09:03,510 --> 00:09:04,870
Scandal photos?

130
00:09:04,940 --> 00:09:06,280
The ones I took and showed you of Calvin and your wife.

131
00:09:06,280 --> 00:09:08,440
The pictures from the scandal article.

132
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:09,550
No.

133
00:09:09,610 --> 00:09:11,680
No, there's no way Kyung Tae would know about that.

134
00:09:11,710 --> 00:09:13,980
I'm telling you, that guy is really suspicious.

135
00:09:14,150 --> 00:09:16,420
Do you think her feelings...

136
00:09:17,520 --> 00:09:19,460
will change that easily, all of a sudden?

137
00:09:19,520 --> 00:09:21,190
Instead of just confessing blindly,

138
00:09:21,420 --> 00:09:23,190
don't you think you should wait for the right moment?

139
00:09:23,260 --> 00:09:27,260
I gave that same herbal medicine to Mi Young.

140
00:09:27,330 --> 00:09:30,630
But did that medicine really cause Mi Young to...

141
00:09:30,700 --> 00:09:32,900
No. I think there must have been a mix-up.

142
00:09:37,870 --> 00:09:39,380
(Restricted Area)

143
00:09:39,440 --> 00:09:44,210
I did not even notice. How dumb. I'm such an idiot.

144
00:10:00,900 --> 00:10:02,470
Did we have a lot of customers today?

145
00:10:02,530 --> 00:10:03,600
Well...

146
00:10:03,670 --> 00:10:06,300
No, just an average amount.

147
00:10:06,340 --> 00:10:10,610
Oh, right. What time is the fitting for the bride Park Eun Bin today?

148
00:10:10,710 --> 00:10:12,980
What? Oh, well...

149
00:10:14,210 --> 00:10:16,610
What time was it again?

150
00:10:16,680 --> 00:10:18,110
What is wrong with you?

151
00:10:18,780 --> 00:10:20,580
Did something happen while I was gone?

152
00:10:25,090 --> 00:10:26,290
Mi Young.

153
00:10:33,860 --> 00:10:35,730
(Operating Room)

154
00:10:36,730 --> 00:10:38,330
How did it go, Doctor?

155
00:10:38,400 --> 00:10:40,370
Fortunately, the injury was not severe,

156
00:10:40,440 --> 00:10:42,770
so the surgery went well.

157
00:10:42,840 --> 00:10:44,970
The patient will be moved to a regular room soon.

158
00:10:45,040 --> 00:10:46,510
Oh, thank you.

159
00:10:46,580 --> 00:10:48,380
Thank you for your hard work. Thank you.

160
00:10:59,490 --> 00:11:02,260
Ahn Hee Ju is hospitalized right now.

161
00:11:04,630 --> 00:11:05,760
(Maesan Hospital)

162
00:11:05,830 --> 00:11:07,800
I told you clearly.

163
00:11:07,860 --> 00:11:10,330
That Kang Kyung Tae pushed me off the cliff.

164
00:11:11,130 --> 00:11:13,400
But you completely ignored me and did not believe a word I said.

165
00:11:13,470 --> 00:11:16,510
Look. I almost died.

166
00:11:16,570 --> 00:11:19,280
- I really have nothing to say. - Whatever.

167
00:11:19,340 --> 00:11:21,910
I will get my revenge twice over,

168
00:11:21,980 --> 00:11:24,410
no, ten times over.

169
00:11:24,950 --> 00:11:28,020
- Revenge? - I will report it right away...

170
00:11:28,080 --> 00:11:29,550
and spread it all over the internet.

171
00:11:33,290 --> 00:11:34,560
Hee Ju, I will apologize on his behalf,

172
00:11:34,620 --> 00:11:37,090
ten times, a hundred times over. And as for Kyung Tae's crimes,

173
00:11:37,160 --> 00:11:40,130
- I will make sure he pays somehow. - Stop it!

174
00:11:40,260 --> 00:11:41,630
That will not work on me anymore.

175
00:11:42,770 --> 00:11:43,930
CEO Ji,

176
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:46,200
you have no right to ask me for any favours now.

177
00:11:48,800 --> 00:11:50,840
You are right. I am sorry, Hee Ju.

178
00:11:51,540 --> 00:11:52,880
Get out.

179
00:11:53,180 --> 00:11:54,210
I want to rest.

180
00:12:28,110 --> 00:12:29,350
Did you really not know?

181
00:12:31,280 --> 00:12:33,080
I did not know.

182
00:12:33,150 --> 00:12:35,320
I had no idea he would go as far as kidnapping Hee Ju.

183
00:12:35,380 --> 00:12:37,790
My question was not about the kidnapping.

184
00:12:38,420 --> 00:12:40,660
It was about Kang Kyung Tae's secret.

185
00:12:40,720 --> 00:12:42,690
It would have been better if I did not know.

186
00:12:43,260 --> 00:12:45,330
That medicine Mi Young took when she was pregnant.

187
00:12:47,300 --> 00:12:49,430
It turns out Kyung Tae swapped it on purpose.

188
00:12:54,870 --> 00:12:56,010
If Mi Young finds out about this,

189
00:12:56,070 --> 00:12:58,610
it is obvious she will be incredibly shocked and hurt again.

190
00:12:59,740 --> 00:13:00,780
Ji Won Ho.

191
00:13:10,220 --> 00:13:11,220
Get up.

192
00:13:21,600 --> 00:13:24,030
While that ridiculous bastard...

193
00:13:24,100 --> 00:13:25,740
was doing something like that to Mi Young,

194
00:13:26,840 --> 00:13:28,200
what were you doing, you jerk?

195
00:13:30,040 --> 00:13:31,070
Go on, tell me.

196
00:13:32,540 --> 00:13:35,040
What can you possibly do for Mi Young from now on?

197
00:13:36,110 --> 00:13:38,510
Let us hear it from that smart mouth of yours.

198
00:13:44,590 --> 00:13:45,920
Nothing.

199
00:13:45,990 --> 00:13:46,990
What?

200
00:13:48,060 --> 00:13:50,860
There is absolutely nothing I can do for Mi Young.

201
00:13:54,300 --> 00:13:57,600
(J&White)

202
00:14:06,040 --> 00:14:08,640
Won Ho, why didn't you pick up your phone?

203
00:14:09,050 --> 00:14:11,180
Why? Why did you call?

204
00:14:11,210 --> 00:14:13,380
I heard Kyung Tae got into an accident.

205
00:14:13,450 --> 00:14:16,690
I heard a bit about it from A Ri. How is Kyung Tae? Is he okay?

206
00:14:16,750 --> 00:14:17,750
Which hospital is he at?

207
00:14:17,820 --> 00:14:19,520
He is fine, so do not worry about it.

208
00:14:20,220 --> 00:14:22,490
Do not worry about it? What do you mean...

209
00:14:23,930 --> 00:14:25,660
You said you are not going to live with me anymore.

210
00:14:25,730 --> 00:14:26,730
What?

211
00:14:26,800 --> 00:14:28,760
You said you are divorcing me and leaving the company.

212
00:14:28,830 --> 00:14:30,800
So what does Kyung Tae have to do with you now?

213
00:14:30,800 --> 00:14:34,540
So what you are saying is, since we are becoming strangers now,

214
00:14:34,600 --> 00:14:36,340
Kyung Tae is a stranger to me too, is that it?

215
00:14:36,410 --> 00:14:39,480
So I do not even have the right to worry about him?

216
00:14:39,540 --> 00:14:41,040
Yes, you understand perfectly.

217
00:14:42,880 --> 00:14:45,610
But this is going too far.

218
00:14:45,680 --> 00:14:47,780
Why are you acting like this?

219
00:14:47,850 --> 00:14:50,390
You need to stop being so hypocritical.

220
00:14:50,420 --> 00:14:53,160
You are the most important person in the world to yourself.

221
00:14:53,190 --> 00:14:54,820
So stop pretending to care about others for no reason,

222
00:14:54,890 --> 00:14:57,130
and just worry about your own future now.

223
00:14:57,590 --> 00:14:59,030
Won Ho.

224
00:14:59,100 --> 00:15:00,200
If you are done, will you please leave?

225
00:15:00,260 --> 00:15:01,260
I have a lot of work to do.

226
00:15:04,400 --> 00:15:06,440
He was like a completely different person.

227
00:15:07,000 --> 00:15:10,510
This is the first time Won Ho has felt so unfamiliar to me.

228
00:15:10,810 --> 00:15:14,610
How can a person change so coldly overnight like this?

229
00:15:14,840 --> 00:15:17,310
Won Ho must be in a lot of shock too.

230
00:15:17,980 --> 00:15:18,980
Shock?

231
00:15:20,480 --> 00:15:23,320
Please pretend you do not know anything about Kyung Tae.

232
00:15:23,350 --> 00:15:24,820
I am begging you.

233
00:15:25,390 --> 00:15:27,690
With Kyung Tae's accident and all.

234
00:15:28,790 --> 00:15:32,160
Also, there is no way Won Ho has good feelings toward you.

235
00:15:32,860 --> 00:15:35,970
And you rejected Won Ho's proposal too.

236
00:15:36,100 --> 00:15:38,870
Still, for him to criticize me for worrying about Kyung Tae...

237
00:15:39,900 --> 00:15:41,200
does not make any sense.

238
00:15:41,270 --> 00:15:44,610
He might be doing it on purpose to detach himself from you.

239
00:15:45,270 --> 00:15:46,780
To detach himself?

240
00:15:46,780 --> 00:15:48,110
Of course he has to.

241
00:15:48,610 --> 00:15:51,680
The only thing left between Won Ho and you now is the divorce.

242
00:16:03,760 --> 00:16:04,860
What is this?

243
00:16:05,290 --> 00:16:06,560
And what is that?

244
00:16:06,630 --> 00:16:08,760
What is with this VIP room?

245
00:16:08,930 --> 00:16:10,600
Stay here until you get discharged.

246
00:16:10,700 --> 00:16:13,700
I mean, why are you doing this to me?

247
00:16:13,770 --> 00:16:16,810
- I changed my mind about you. - What do you mean?

248
00:16:16,840 --> 00:16:20,040
At first, I thought you were a hopeless case beyond saving,

249
00:16:20,080 --> 00:16:21,410
but looking at you now,

250
00:16:21,480 --> 00:16:23,450
you are a very persistent hopeless case.

251
00:16:24,910 --> 00:16:28,050
Now I get it. You are worried I might do something...

252
00:16:28,120 --> 00:16:30,050
to CEO Baek Mi Young, right?

253
00:16:30,120 --> 00:16:31,990
You are doing this because you are anxious about that.

254
00:16:32,050 --> 00:16:34,860
- Just tell me what you want. - Forget it. I do not need anything.

255
00:16:34,920 --> 00:16:36,060
I am going to expose everything.

256
00:16:37,630 --> 00:16:38,630
Secretary Han.

257
00:16:45,070 --> 00:16:46,070
Open it.

258
00:16:49,410 --> 00:16:50,670
(Letter of Recommendation)

259
00:16:51,810 --> 00:16:54,240
- This is... - You know Ferra Show, right?

260
00:16:54,310 --> 00:16:56,080
He is a famous photographer in Italy.

261
00:16:56,150 --> 00:16:58,510
Famous is an understatement.

262
00:16:58,580 --> 00:17:01,050
Ferra Show is a legend himself.

263
00:17:01,120 --> 00:17:03,020
Anyway, it is a letter of recommendation from him.

264
00:17:03,090 --> 00:17:04,520
With that one letter of recommendation,

265
00:17:04,590 --> 00:17:06,060
whether it is Milan or New York,

266
00:17:06,120 --> 00:17:09,660
you will be able to work anywhere you want.

267
00:17:09,730 --> 00:17:11,630
Is this real?

268
00:17:12,360 --> 00:17:13,600
Secretary Han.

269
00:17:13,960 --> 00:17:16,130
Oh, who said I did not believe you?

270
00:17:16,770 --> 00:17:19,870
That should be enough for you to keep your mouth shut, right?

271
00:17:34,220 --> 00:17:35,380
Ji Won Ho.

272
00:17:35,990 --> 00:17:38,050
I kept my promise.

273
00:17:39,050 --> 00:17:41,260
Now it is your turn.

274
00:17:46,460 --> 00:17:49,300
There is nothing I can do for Mi Young.

275
00:17:49,870 --> 00:17:51,830
So please help her, Calvin.

276
00:17:52,330 --> 00:17:53,500
All right, then.

277
00:17:54,140 --> 00:17:55,170
In return,

278
00:17:55,900 --> 00:17:57,840
you need to make me a promise too.

279
00:18:00,010 --> 00:18:01,240
That ring.

280
00:18:02,140 --> 00:18:04,980
I want you to take it out of your life completely now.

281
00:18:06,020 --> 00:18:07,050
The ring...

282
00:18:08,520 --> 00:18:09,550
and Mi Young too.

283
00:18:31,370 --> 00:18:33,880
I will keep my promise.

284
00:18:48,220 --> 00:18:49,390
Just wait a little bit.

285
00:18:50,590 --> 00:18:52,800
We are almost there now.

286
00:19:02,340 --> 00:19:03,870
Then what on earth is it?

287
00:19:03,940 --> 00:19:06,740
Stop frustrating me and just tell me.

288
00:19:07,340 --> 00:19:09,850
What kind of medicine did you take and how?

289
00:19:09,910 --> 00:19:11,710
So the misunderstanding is all cleared up now, right?

290
00:19:11,710 --> 00:19:13,480
How many times do I have to tell you?

291
00:19:13,550 --> 00:19:16,120
Hey, will you spend the rest of your life thinking about Dallae?

292
00:19:16,190 --> 00:19:18,020
Because of a child you never even gave birth to or raised,

293
00:19:18,090 --> 00:19:19,890
for you to be like this for years...

294
00:19:20,490 --> 00:19:22,120
is just being overly dramatic.

295
00:19:39,640 --> 00:19:41,680
You said you are divorcing me and leaving the company.

296
00:19:41,740 --> 00:19:43,810
So what does Kyung Tae have to do with you now?

297
00:19:43,880 --> 00:19:45,710
But this is going too far.

298
00:19:45,780 --> 00:19:47,950
You need to stop being so hypocritical.

299
00:19:56,390 --> 00:19:57,890
To detach himself?

300
00:19:57,960 --> 00:19:59,430
Of course he has to.

301
00:19:59,500 --> 00:20:02,500
The only thing left between Won Ho and you now is the divorce.

302
00:20:39,700 --> 00:20:42,500
(J&White)

303
00:20:43,510 --> 00:20:45,340
You sold what?

304
00:20:45,410 --> 00:20:48,040
I told you. I sold J&White.

305
00:20:48,410 --> 00:20:50,880
You really sold the company?

306
00:20:50,950 --> 00:20:54,120
- I sold it with a decent premium. - Won Ho.

307
00:20:54,980 --> 00:20:57,420
Have you lost your mind?

308
00:20:57,850 --> 00:20:59,420
Do you know what kind of company this is?

309
00:20:59,490 --> 00:21:03,290
How could you just sell it? After everything we did to build it.

310
00:21:03,760 --> 00:21:06,230
So what? Once you leave the company anyway,

311
00:21:06,300 --> 00:21:09,900
- it will not be J&White anymore. - What does that mean?

312
00:21:09,970 --> 00:21:12,570
You are the designer for J&White.

313
00:21:12,630 --> 00:21:14,540
The identity of J&White comes from you.

314
00:21:14,600 --> 00:21:17,770
- You always emphasized that. - Why does identity matter?

315
00:21:17,840 --> 00:21:19,310
Money is what matters.

316
00:21:19,880 --> 00:21:22,440
- Won Ho. - Competitors keep increasing,

317
00:21:22,510 --> 00:21:24,250
and sales are steadily dropping.

318
00:21:24,310 --> 00:21:26,750
On top of that, I have to give you your share of the assets.

319
00:21:27,880 --> 00:21:30,550
It is a matter of time before rumours spread in industry.

320
00:21:30,720 --> 00:21:32,720
I honestly doubt whether clients will keep coming...

321
00:21:32,790 --> 00:21:34,420
to us after that.

322
00:21:34,490 --> 00:21:35,990
Anyway, if I have to dispose of the company,

323
00:21:36,060 --> 00:21:38,260
I felt like now was the best time,

324
00:21:38,330 --> 00:21:39,900
so I made that decision.

325
00:21:39,930 --> 00:21:42,030
So you are saying it is because of me.

326
00:21:43,230 --> 00:21:45,300
Even so, this does not seem right.

327
00:21:45,300 --> 00:21:48,370
- Who did you hand it over to? - If I tell you,

328
00:21:49,070 --> 00:21:51,740
- are you going to get it back? - Of course!

329
00:21:51,810 --> 00:21:54,010
I have to get it back, no matter what it takes.

330
00:21:54,080 --> 00:21:55,510
Do not waste your energy.

331
00:21:55,880 --> 00:21:58,650
- The papers are already signed. - Do not be mistaken.

332
00:21:59,050 --> 00:22:02,950
Half of the shares in this company are still clearly mine.

333
00:22:02,950 --> 00:22:04,450
Without my consent,

334
00:22:04,590 --> 00:22:06,790
you cannot hand J&White over to anyone.

335
00:22:08,760 --> 00:22:11,890
But who on earth said they would buy this company?

336
00:22:13,730 --> 00:22:16,600
Was that it? The method you finally came up with...

337
00:22:16,730 --> 00:22:18,230
was taking J&White away?

338
00:22:20,900 --> 00:22:25,110
I told you clearly. I will never go back to you.

339
00:22:30,510 --> 00:22:31,750
Mi Young, I heard...

340
00:22:32,210 --> 00:22:34,850
you told Ji Won Ho you were quitting the company.

341
00:22:34,920 --> 00:22:38,290
- What? - That is what I heard from Won Ho.

342
00:22:38,620 --> 00:22:40,520
That is true, but...

343
00:22:40,590 --> 00:22:43,360
If you were going to stay on as the CEO of J&White,

344
00:22:43,360 --> 00:22:45,890
I never would have acquired it either.

345
00:22:47,500 --> 00:22:51,570
According to our research, the legal shares of J&White on paper...

346
00:22:51,630 --> 00:22:55,540
all belonged to Ji Won Ho. Ji Won Ho also actively appealed...

347
00:22:55,600 --> 00:22:57,410
that he wanted to sell J&White,

348
00:22:57,470 --> 00:23:01,110
and I just happened to need J&White's brand value.

349
00:23:02,540 --> 00:23:06,250
Ji Won Ho and I made a transaction out of necessity.

350
00:23:06,320 --> 00:23:09,020
Completely excluding our personal feelings.

351
00:23:09,080 --> 00:23:13,460
J&White is like a child to my husband and me.

352
00:23:14,520 --> 00:23:16,690
I cannot give it up so easily.

353
00:23:16,990 --> 00:23:21,160
I am begging you. Your decision to acquire J&White.

354
00:23:21,230 --> 00:23:23,070
Could you please cancel it?

355
00:23:24,770 --> 00:23:25,830
No.

356
00:23:26,470 --> 00:23:28,470
- What? - J&White is now...

357
00:23:29,540 --> 00:23:30,540
mine.

358
00:23:33,240 --> 00:23:35,110
What are you talking about?

359
00:23:35,180 --> 00:23:37,350
Selling the company without consulting your wife?

360
00:23:37,410 --> 00:23:38,550
The trial is right around the corner.

361
00:23:38,610 --> 00:23:42,450
- Are you out of your mind? - That is why I am in so much pain.

362
00:23:44,050 --> 00:23:46,220
It is hard to stay sane in this situation.

363
00:23:47,220 --> 00:23:49,020
There must be something else.

364
00:23:49,090 --> 00:23:51,490
About my wife having a miscarriage...

365
00:23:52,230 --> 00:23:53,930
because of the medicine I gave her.

366
00:23:55,200 --> 00:23:56,200
It turns out,

367
00:23:56,260 --> 00:23:59,200
someone intentionally switched the medicine.

368
00:23:59,230 --> 00:24:03,970
Who on earth was it? Who would dare do such a thing?

369
00:24:04,910 --> 00:24:06,510
It was an acquaintance of mine.

370
00:24:07,840 --> 00:24:10,150
How could such a thing happen?

371
00:24:13,080 --> 00:24:14,920
I am having such a hard time with this.

372
00:24:15,820 --> 00:24:18,190
If my wife finds out, she probably...

373
00:24:19,290 --> 00:24:20,820
will not be able to handle it at all.

374
00:24:21,590 --> 00:24:22,790
Oh, my.

375
00:24:23,130 --> 00:24:25,060
That is why I sold the company.

376
00:24:25,090 --> 00:24:28,460
To make sure my wife never finds out about this.

377
00:24:28,530 --> 00:24:29,530
Oh, my...

378
00:24:32,930 --> 00:24:34,600
But you know,

379
00:24:34,670 --> 00:24:36,510
would it not be better to just be transparent...

380
00:24:36,570 --> 00:24:38,370
and tell her everything?

381
00:24:39,070 --> 00:24:40,810
Then you can clear your name as a murderer.

382
00:24:40,880 --> 00:24:42,580
The misunderstanding will naturally be resolved.

383
00:24:42,640 --> 00:24:45,610
And if things go well, you two could get back together.

384
00:24:46,980 --> 00:24:48,320
No.

385
00:24:49,050 --> 00:24:50,390
I do not want that.

386
00:24:51,420 --> 00:24:52,650
You do not want that?

387
00:24:52,720 --> 00:24:54,460
From now on, I want my wife...

388
00:24:54,520 --> 00:24:57,060
to only experience beautiful and good things.

389
00:24:59,090 --> 00:25:01,760
But for that to happen, I cannot be by her side.

390
00:25:01,830 --> 00:25:03,200
Oh, my.

391
00:25:04,130 --> 00:25:06,100
So I am going to let her go, no matter what.

392
00:25:06,670 --> 00:25:09,000
As far away as possible,

393
00:25:09,070 --> 00:25:10,640
to the best place possible.

394
00:25:12,810 --> 00:25:14,840
Will you not regret that choice?

395
00:25:15,640 --> 00:25:17,150
For my wife,

396
00:25:18,410 --> 00:25:19,880
this is for the best.

397
00:25:20,680 --> 00:25:24,150
Your husband sold the company on his own at this point.

398
00:25:27,660 --> 00:25:29,990
That is an absolute win for us.

399
00:25:31,090 --> 00:25:34,030
First, ignoring his spouse's wishes...

400
00:25:34,100 --> 00:25:38,600
and selling off joint property will work in our favour.

401
00:25:39,570 --> 00:25:41,640
Most importantly, if he disposes of the company,

402
00:25:41,700 --> 00:25:43,640
the amount of property division we can get right away...

403
00:25:43,710 --> 00:25:45,370
will be much larger, right?

404
00:25:45,810 --> 00:25:47,380
But why are you...

405
00:25:47,440 --> 00:25:49,880
opposing it?

406
00:25:52,810 --> 00:25:54,180
I mean, why?

407
00:25:54,920 --> 00:25:57,320
Why are you trying to ruin a perfect opportunity?

408
00:25:57,390 --> 00:25:59,150
To my husband and me,

409
00:25:59,860 --> 00:26:01,060
this company...

410
00:26:01,860 --> 00:26:03,090
is our child.

411
00:26:04,390 --> 00:26:05,960
There is not a single place in this company...

412
00:26:06,030 --> 00:26:10,770
that we have not touched. We raised it with all our hearts.

413
00:26:10,830 --> 00:26:11,930
How...

414
00:26:12,000 --> 00:26:13,870
How can I hand it over to someone else?

415
00:26:15,640 --> 00:26:16,970
I cannot do that.

416
00:26:17,040 --> 00:26:18,540
Then in court,

417
00:26:19,270 --> 00:26:22,480
we should also claim management rights for the company.

418
00:26:23,310 --> 00:26:24,410
Excuse me?

419
00:26:25,450 --> 00:26:28,580
If this company is truly your child, Mi Young,

420
00:26:28,680 --> 00:26:31,490
and we consider the rights to the company as custody,

421
00:26:31,490 --> 00:26:33,190
rather than your husband,

422
00:26:33,190 --> 00:26:35,090
who gave over the child without discussing it with his spouse,

423
00:26:35,660 --> 00:26:38,560
you, who fought tooth and nail to get the child back,

424
00:26:38,630 --> 00:26:40,430
should be the one to take charge of the company.

425
00:26:41,730 --> 00:26:43,770
- The management of the company... - No.

426
00:26:43,830 --> 00:26:45,430
- What? - Taking charge of the company...

427
00:26:45,430 --> 00:26:46,670
is not what matters here.

428
00:26:47,070 --> 00:26:49,100
Protecting the company is what matters.

429
00:26:49,970 --> 00:26:51,310
And...

430
00:26:51,340 --> 00:26:54,540
if one of us has to take responsibility for this company,

431
00:26:55,240 --> 00:26:56,310
it...

432
00:26:57,680 --> 00:26:59,150
has to be my husband.

433
00:27:16,200 --> 00:27:18,200
Gosh, it can't be.

434
00:27:18,670 --> 00:27:20,940
Goodness, I keep seeing things.

435
00:27:21,040 --> 00:27:22,700
Should I get some herbal medicine?

436
00:27:37,790 --> 00:27:38,950
Have you been well?

437
00:27:42,460 --> 00:27:43,490
Seung Ho!

438
00:27:45,360 --> 00:27:47,500
- Are you okay? - You are real?

439
00:27:48,060 --> 00:27:51,900
- Oh, it really is you, Ms. Jeon. - Of course I am real.

440
00:27:53,200 --> 00:27:55,170
No, I mean...

441
00:27:55,570 --> 00:27:58,840
I thought you would never come back, so I could not even imagine it.

442
00:27:58,910 --> 00:28:02,380
I was a bit reluctant to come back, but I had no choice.

443
00:28:03,040 --> 00:28:05,010
Since this place is a hotbed for affairs.

444
00:28:05,010 --> 00:28:06,080
Excuse me?

445
00:28:06,210 --> 00:28:09,750
- And a hotspot for CCTV footage. - Oh, come on, I thought...

446
00:28:09,820 --> 00:28:10,820
You thought what?

447
00:28:10,890 --> 00:28:12,790
- Should I leave then? - No.

448
00:28:12,850 --> 00:28:15,560
You are right. This is a hotspot. Over the past few days,

449
00:28:15,990 --> 00:28:17,460
I have collected a ton of footage.

450
00:28:32,840 --> 00:28:36,010
Mi Young did? Did Mi Young really say that?

451
00:28:37,050 --> 00:28:39,380
Yes. She said the company...

452
00:28:40,050 --> 00:28:42,380
must be entrusted to her husband, no matter what.

453
00:28:42,420 --> 00:28:45,120
Is she trying to kill him with kindness?

454
00:28:46,690 --> 00:28:47,820
For that,

455
00:28:47,890 --> 00:28:49,990
management rights are too big a kindness, right?

456
00:28:49,990 --> 00:28:51,060
True.

457
00:28:51,690 --> 00:28:55,000
No, but what is Mi Young really thinking?

458
00:28:55,530 --> 00:28:58,670
The affection from raising a child together?

459
00:28:58,970 --> 00:29:02,370
- A child? - When I talk to Mi Young,

460
00:29:02,400 --> 00:29:06,410
I can feel how deep her affection is for her child.

461
00:29:07,110 --> 00:29:08,740
Of course, it is not a real child...

462
00:29:08,810 --> 00:29:11,450
- but a company like a child. - I know.

463
00:29:12,550 --> 00:29:15,120
I know just how much Mi Young cares for her child.

464
00:29:16,120 --> 00:29:17,120
Right.

465
00:29:35,700 --> 00:29:36,710
Come in.

466
00:29:39,740 --> 00:29:42,080
This place is amazing. What is this?

467
00:29:44,150 --> 00:29:45,380
Are you all ready?

468
00:29:46,210 --> 00:29:48,180
Let us finish your discharge paperwork quickly and go eat.

469
00:29:52,090 --> 00:29:53,660
Thank you.

470
00:29:54,190 --> 00:29:55,990
Gosh, this looks delicious. Hurry up and try it.

471
00:29:56,060 --> 00:29:57,490
They say this place has the best abalone porridge.

472
00:29:59,960 --> 00:30:01,530
Why did you come here?

473
00:30:01,600 --> 00:30:04,570
What do you mean? I am in charge of your discharge.

474
00:30:04,630 --> 00:30:07,500
Seriously, how do you end up in the hospital so regularly?

475
00:30:07,540 --> 00:30:09,700
And the intervals seem to be getting shorter.

476
00:30:09,800 --> 00:30:11,710
I do not like you anymore, CEO Ji.

477
00:30:13,140 --> 00:30:14,940
You do not have to do this.

478
00:30:15,210 --> 00:30:16,880
From now on,

479
00:30:16,950 --> 00:30:18,880
I will not be clinging to you anymore.

480
00:30:21,250 --> 00:30:23,050
Gosh, I am a little disappointed.

481
00:30:23,520 --> 00:30:25,420
Do not say things you do not mean.

482
00:30:26,690 --> 00:30:29,190
You pretended not to notice all this time.

483
00:30:29,290 --> 00:30:30,290
Right.

484
00:30:30,360 --> 00:30:32,630
For making you feel neglected all this time,

485
00:30:32,660 --> 00:30:33,800
I am sorry.

486
00:30:34,530 --> 00:30:35,800
So about that...

487
00:30:40,570 --> 00:30:43,440
I hope this makes you feel a bit better.

488
00:30:47,340 --> 00:30:48,440
(Via Tommaso Gulli, 31 Milano mi)

489
00:30:48,510 --> 00:30:51,280
It is the address of your father and stepmother's new house.

490
00:30:52,110 --> 00:30:53,480
Your father said that if I see you,

491
00:30:53,550 --> 00:30:58,020
- I should give this to you. - You met my dad?

492
00:30:58,090 --> 00:31:00,660
Come on, how could I meet someone who lives in Milan?

493
00:31:00,720 --> 00:31:01,820
We talked on the phone.

494
00:31:02,390 --> 00:31:04,890
I contacted everyone with the last name Ahn living in Milan,

495
00:31:04,960 --> 00:31:06,530
and I barely managed to find him.

496
00:31:07,060 --> 00:31:08,300
What did...

497
00:31:09,030 --> 00:31:11,530
- my dad say? - Well, what do you think?

498
00:31:13,500 --> 00:31:15,640
It turns out there was something you did not tell me.

499
00:31:15,700 --> 00:31:18,040
I heard you cursed at your stepmother first.

500
00:31:18,110 --> 00:31:19,970
Gosh, I knew it.

501
00:31:22,010 --> 00:31:23,010
When I called, the first thing he asked...

502
00:31:23,080 --> 00:31:24,780
was how you were doing.

503
00:31:25,280 --> 00:31:27,580
He asked if you were healthy and feeling well.

504
00:31:28,580 --> 00:31:30,820
Since when did he worry about me?

505
00:31:32,350 --> 00:31:35,390
He said he'd wait until you come back.

506
00:31:36,590 --> 00:31:39,360
He said you can come back whenever you want.

507
00:31:43,930 --> 00:31:44,970
Did he...

508
00:31:46,100 --> 00:31:47,140
really say that?

509
00:31:48,940 --> 00:31:52,410
- He is waiting for me? - You were waiting for him too.

510
00:31:53,510 --> 00:31:56,580
Because it was too hard just waiting for your father to contact you,

511
00:31:56,640 --> 00:31:58,280
you were acting out.

512
00:32:10,230 --> 00:32:12,830
Ji Won Ho, it went exactly as expected.

513
00:32:15,100 --> 00:32:18,000
You are going to sell J&White to me?

514
00:32:18,070 --> 00:32:21,100
Then Mi Young will definitely try to get it back.

515
00:32:21,470 --> 00:32:23,300
Whatever conditions you propose, Calvin,

516
00:32:23,340 --> 00:32:24,610
she will accept them.

517
00:32:40,520 --> 00:32:41,690
J&White.

518
00:32:42,590 --> 00:32:43,990
I got it back.

519
00:32:45,590 --> 00:32:48,200
No matter how hard I try, I cannot understand.

520
00:32:48,230 --> 00:32:49,930
Why you sold the company,

521
00:32:50,000 --> 00:32:52,470
and why it had to be to Calvin, of all people.

522
00:32:52,530 --> 00:32:55,170
How could you do that?

523
00:32:58,140 --> 00:32:59,210
I told you.

524
00:33:00,540 --> 00:33:01,710
I needed the money.

525
00:33:02,980 --> 00:33:05,280
Thanks to you, my cash flow is completely blocked again.

526
00:33:05,350 --> 00:33:09,120
That darn money. Is money that important?

527
00:33:09,180 --> 00:33:10,350
Is it so important that you can throw away...

528
00:33:10,420 --> 00:33:12,350
your pride and everything else?

529
00:33:12,390 --> 00:33:15,060
Enough for you to throw away what is most important for you?

530
00:33:15,120 --> 00:33:16,360
Seriously.

531
00:33:16,420 --> 00:33:18,290
Won Ho, are you really that low?

532
00:33:19,830 --> 00:33:21,260
J&White.

533
00:33:22,100 --> 00:33:25,730
It is like a child to us, and it is your alter ego, Won Ho.

534
00:33:25,830 --> 00:33:30,000
You should not take it so lightly and sell it off so easily.

535
00:33:35,080 --> 00:33:36,510
I will keep your words in mind.

536
00:33:39,480 --> 00:33:40,580
Oh, and...

537
00:33:41,580 --> 00:33:43,520
I decided to take the CEO position...

538
00:33:44,220 --> 00:33:45,720
at Calvin Wedding Hall.

539
00:33:48,020 --> 00:33:49,220
Congratulations.

540
00:33:49,760 --> 00:33:52,830
I should resign and leave the company right away,

541
00:33:52,890 --> 00:33:55,300
but for a while, I will go back and forth...

542
00:33:56,460 --> 00:33:58,130
to wrap things up at J&White.

543
00:33:59,670 --> 00:34:01,970
Okay. I understand.

544
00:34:13,350 --> 00:34:14,680
You took off your ring.

545
00:34:19,820 --> 00:34:21,320
Yes, I meant to take it off a long time ago.

546
00:34:23,630 --> 00:34:24,630
I see.

547
00:35:14,880 --> 00:35:17,950
(Hope General Hospital)

548
00:35:18,980 --> 00:35:21,020
The day Hee Ju went to the cliff for the photoshoot,

549
00:35:22,580 --> 00:35:24,590
I secretly followed her...

550
00:35:25,450 --> 00:35:27,290
and pushed her off the cliff.

551
00:35:29,560 --> 00:35:33,730
And I kidnapped her at night and locked her in my house.

552
00:35:35,660 --> 00:35:38,430
I secretly entered the house of Kim Yu Ju,

553
00:35:38,500 --> 00:35:40,640
who was supposed to be in the Trunk Show finale,

554
00:35:41,800 --> 00:35:44,040
and injured her.

555
00:35:47,340 --> 00:35:49,310
I was afraid Won Ho and Mi Young...

556
00:35:50,240 --> 00:35:53,920
would get back together If the show was a success,

557
00:35:55,150 --> 00:35:56,720
so I wanted to ruin the show.

558
00:35:59,090 --> 00:36:01,220
Lastly, the most unforgivable thing I did is...

559
00:36:02,220 --> 00:36:03,320
(Herbal medicine pregnant women should avoid)

560
00:36:03,560 --> 00:36:05,530
I switched Mi Young's herbal medicine...

561
00:36:07,200 --> 00:36:09,300
and caused her to miscarry her child.

562
00:36:11,470 --> 00:36:12,470
That is all.

563
00:36:12,530 --> 00:36:14,140
(Voice Recording)

564
00:36:16,870 --> 00:36:18,010
This should be enough.

565
00:36:20,010 --> 00:36:22,680
I am ready to be punished now.

566
00:36:24,280 --> 00:36:25,280
And...

567
00:36:27,350 --> 00:36:28,950
I am really sorry, Won Ho.

568
00:36:28,980 --> 00:36:30,420
What are you doing right now?

569
00:36:30,890 --> 00:36:32,020
I am fine now.

570
00:36:34,060 --> 00:36:37,930
There is no need to drag this out here anymore.

571
00:36:38,030 --> 00:36:39,030
Are you a doctor?

572
00:36:40,290 --> 00:36:42,960
Just wait quietly until the doctor tells you to discharge.

573
00:36:44,130 --> 00:36:47,070
Then I will put you in prison even if you do not want to go.

574
00:36:47,100 --> 00:36:48,140
You should not have...

575
00:36:49,940 --> 00:36:51,370
saved me back then.

576
00:36:52,970 --> 00:36:54,510
If you had not saved me,

577
00:36:56,340 --> 00:36:58,350
nothing bad would have happened to Dallae.

578
00:37:00,450 --> 00:37:01,880
Because you saved me...

579
00:37:02,880 --> 00:37:03,920
I really...

580
00:37:05,520 --> 00:37:07,120
do not want to live anymore.

581
00:37:07,160 --> 00:37:09,890
No, you have to live no matter what.

582
00:37:12,630 --> 00:37:15,960
You have to live and go through it all.

583
00:37:17,030 --> 00:37:18,830
You need to know what it is like to live in a living hell,

584
00:37:19,700 --> 00:37:22,540
and what it feels like to live with guilt...

585
00:37:24,840 --> 00:37:25,970
and longing for life.

586
00:37:33,280 --> 00:37:34,350
So, Kyung Tae.

587
00:37:35,950 --> 00:37:39,690
Please live a long and healthy life.

588
00:37:41,060 --> 00:37:42,390
Live a long life...

589
00:37:43,830 --> 00:37:45,290
and suffer every moment of it.

590
00:37:47,900 --> 00:37:49,030
And never...

591
00:37:50,200 --> 00:37:51,600
appear in front of me again.

592
00:38:11,890 --> 00:38:15,790
(CEO Baek Mi Young)

593
00:38:26,730 --> 00:38:27,900
Mother.

594
00:38:33,540 --> 00:38:35,180
You look very haggard.

595
00:38:36,010 --> 00:38:38,310
Work is important, but take care of your health too.

596
00:38:39,510 --> 00:38:41,320
You are not in your 20s anymore.

597
00:38:42,350 --> 00:38:43,350
By the way,

598
00:38:44,650 --> 00:38:46,950
what brings you here?

599
00:38:46,950 --> 00:38:49,120
Are you afraid I might grab you by the hair again?

600
00:38:50,560 --> 00:38:52,890
There is something I really want to tell you,

601
00:38:54,300 --> 00:38:56,530
and I thought I would not have the chance if not now.

602
00:39:07,910 --> 00:39:09,180
In my entire life,

603
00:39:10,750 --> 00:39:12,850
there were only three times...

604
00:39:12,880 --> 00:39:13,920
I cried out of joy.

605
00:39:15,250 --> 00:39:19,190
One was when Won Ho won the prize at the fashion competition...

606
00:39:21,020 --> 00:39:24,590
and another one was when our Ha Neul was born.

607
00:39:25,730 --> 00:39:27,190
And the last time was...

608
00:39:29,930 --> 00:39:31,930
when I heard the news that you were pregnant.

609
00:39:33,600 --> 00:39:36,900
You went through IVF and everything to have a baby,

610
00:39:38,740 --> 00:39:40,980
doing something so difficult dozens of times.

611
00:39:42,210 --> 00:39:46,150
When I heard you were pregnant after four years,

612
00:39:48,180 --> 00:39:49,550
I truly...

613
00:39:50,120 --> 00:39:52,620
felt as happy as if I had the whole world.

614
00:39:53,850 --> 00:39:57,660
It must have been so hard on your fragile body.

615
00:39:59,260 --> 00:40:02,230
I was proud of you and thankful.

616
00:40:03,560 --> 00:40:06,870
But because I am old-fashioned,

617
00:40:08,000 --> 00:40:10,200
I could not express all those feelings.

618
00:40:11,340 --> 00:40:14,510
I was worried that making a fuss would bring bad luck...

619
00:40:14,540 --> 00:40:16,180
or that you might lose the baby.

620
00:40:19,480 --> 00:40:21,080
I regret it now.

621
00:40:22,220 --> 00:40:24,350
Even if I could not say thank you back then,

622
00:40:26,320 --> 00:40:27,990
when you lost the baby,

623
00:40:29,460 --> 00:40:31,330
I should have at least told you that it was okay.

624
00:40:33,830 --> 00:40:35,160
Mother.

625
00:40:35,700 --> 00:40:39,900
I held a memorial service so the baby could go to a good place,

626
00:40:39,970 --> 00:40:41,970
and I prayed to Buddha day and night.

627
00:40:43,970 --> 00:40:45,570
So that you can forget everything...

628
00:40:46,770 --> 00:40:48,080
and not hurt anymore.

629
00:40:49,510 --> 00:40:50,510
I am sorry.

630
00:40:52,150 --> 00:40:53,980
I did not come here to hear that.

631
00:40:55,320 --> 00:40:57,020
Now you should forget everything too...

632
00:40:59,590 --> 00:41:01,090
and live your life, Mi Young.

633
00:41:04,690 --> 00:41:07,160
I have something to return to you, and I almost forgot.

634
00:41:10,870 --> 00:41:14,240
This was the best gift...

635
00:41:14,370 --> 00:41:15,870
you ever gave me, Mi Young.

636
00:41:17,810 --> 00:41:18,810
Thank you.

637
00:41:31,320 --> 00:41:32,420
(Dallae, 4 months)

638
00:41:55,580 --> 00:41:57,510
I can contact you sometimes, right?

639
00:41:57,550 --> 00:41:59,980
- Anytime. - What about when I come to Korea?

640
00:42:01,550 --> 00:42:03,250
I understand what you mean.

641
00:42:03,720 --> 00:42:06,290
Stay healthy. I will be rooting for you.

642
00:42:06,350 --> 00:42:07,460
Me too.

643
00:42:07,920 --> 00:42:10,360
By the way, actually,

644
00:42:10,420 --> 00:42:12,630
I have been a long-time fan of yours, CEO Ji.

645
00:42:13,030 --> 00:42:14,460
You were a fan of mine?

646
00:42:14,530 --> 00:42:16,030
When I was in middle school, I accidentally saw...

647
00:42:16,100 --> 00:42:18,730
a dress you made in a magazine.

648
00:42:18,800 --> 00:42:21,600
I fell completely in love with your dress back then.

649
00:42:22,940 --> 00:42:24,740
Even when we ran into each other in Milan,

650
00:42:24,810 --> 00:42:27,070
I recognised you at first sight.

651
00:42:27,140 --> 00:42:30,210
So I thought it was destiny back then.

652
00:42:30,280 --> 00:42:33,050
I see. But why did you not say anything until now?

653
00:42:33,110 --> 00:42:34,880
I do not know.

654
00:42:34,950 --> 00:42:36,780
I guess I just wanted to keep it to myself.

655
00:42:38,650 --> 00:42:41,060
I will cherish it as a good memory for the rest of my life.

656
00:42:41,660 --> 00:42:42,690
Take care.

657
00:42:43,960 --> 00:42:46,860
- Let us not see each other again. - Goodbye, Ahn Hee Ju.

658
00:42:51,670 --> 00:42:54,470
CEO Ji completely ghosted us.

659
00:42:56,100 --> 00:42:57,200
Look at this.

660
00:42:57,270 --> 00:43:00,070
Just leaving a single text message like this.

661
00:43:00,440 --> 00:43:03,910
Manager Song, I am going to go clear my head for a bit.

662
00:43:04,350 --> 00:43:06,550
Please take good care of the company in the meantime.

663
00:43:08,850 --> 00:43:10,720
What kind of company...

664
00:43:10,790 --> 00:43:13,190
has the vice president lying in a hospital bed...

665
00:43:13,250 --> 00:43:14,790
and the CEO ghosting everyone?

666
00:43:15,760 --> 00:43:17,260
Where could he have gone?

667
00:43:17,320 --> 00:43:19,090
Oh, I do not know.

668
00:43:21,030 --> 00:43:22,160
Could it be...

669
00:43:23,530 --> 00:43:25,300
He did not go to Milan, did he?

670
00:43:25,370 --> 00:43:26,530
Milan?

671
00:43:26,600 --> 00:43:29,240
Actually, I accidentally heard CEO Ji...

672
00:43:29,300 --> 00:43:31,770
talking on the phone with someone yesterday,

673
00:43:31,840 --> 00:43:35,440
and it sounded like he was asking what time Hee Ju's flight...

674
00:43:35,510 --> 00:43:37,210
to Milan was departing today.

675
00:43:37,280 --> 00:43:39,050
Hee Ju went to Milan?

676
00:43:40,550 --> 00:43:42,780
Oh, I do not know.

677
00:43:42,850 --> 00:43:43,980
I do not know anything!

678
00:43:45,650 --> 00:43:47,760
I should go drink a cup of coffee. Why am I so sleepy?

679
00:43:55,230 --> 00:43:56,430
You took off your ring.

680
00:43:59,000 --> 00:44:01,870
Yes, I meant to take it off a long time ago.

681
00:44:03,800 --> 00:44:07,040
Manager Song, I am going to go clear my head for a bit.

682
00:44:10,680 --> 00:44:11,680
Mi Young.

683
00:44:13,210 --> 00:44:14,220
Come here for a second.

684
00:44:18,990 --> 00:44:22,360
What do you think? I tried my best to match your taste.

685
00:44:23,660 --> 00:44:24,790
It is better...

686
00:44:26,160 --> 00:44:27,490
than I imagined.

687
00:44:27,560 --> 00:44:29,030
It is all thanks to you.

688
00:44:29,530 --> 00:44:31,930
This is the result of having you here.

689
00:44:31,970 --> 00:44:34,940
Thank you for saying that.

690
00:44:34,970 --> 00:44:37,400
Oh, come on. I should be the one thanking you.

691
00:44:38,440 --> 00:44:39,770
Just say the word from now on.

692
00:44:39,840 --> 00:44:42,840
Whatever you want, whatever you imagine.

693
00:44:42,910 --> 00:44:44,480
I will make it happen right before your eyes.

694
00:44:48,350 --> 00:44:51,890
Do not forget. We are not just selling dresses.

695
00:44:51,920 --> 00:44:54,760
We are selling J&White's philosophy and style.

696
00:44:54,820 --> 00:44:56,160
So be proud, Baek Mi Young.

697
00:44:56,160 --> 00:44:57,990
Straighten your shoulders. You got this!

698
00:45:05,730 --> 00:45:07,130
Mi Young.

699
00:45:07,300 --> 00:45:08,370
Yes.

700
00:45:10,800 --> 00:45:12,340
Look at the time.

701
00:45:12,570 --> 00:45:14,110
Should we grab something to eat?

702
00:45:15,280 --> 00:45:16,280
Sure.

703
00:45:27,920 --> 00:45:29,260
What do you want to eat?

704
00:45:29,260 --> 00:45:31,060
Anything is fine.

705
00:45:31,230 --> 00:45:32,660
I will have whatever you are having.

706
00:45:33,690 --> 00:45:34,700
Really?

707
00:45:37,230 --> 00:45:38,270
That is a tough call.

708
00:45:40,170 --> 00:45:42,640
We will start with two pho, please.

709
00:45:42,670 --> 00:45:44,510
Oh, Mi Young, you do not eat cilantro.

710
00:45:44,570 --> 00:45:46,470
One without cilantro, regular size,

711
00:45:46,510 --> 00:45:48,480
and one with cilantro, large, please.

712
00:45:48,540 --> 00:45:50,310
Is there anything else you need?

713
00:45:50,310 --> 00:45:51,510
- Extra bean sprouts. - Extra bean sprouts.

714
00:45:59,850 --> 00:46:01,390
Still, just pick one.

715
00:46:01,860 --> 00:46:02,890
What?

716
00:46:02,960 --> 00:46:05,490
Or should I just order everything on the menu?

717
00:46:06,090 --> 00:46:08,630
No, I will pick something.

718
00:46:33,790 --> 00:46:35,190
What is it?

719
00:46:35,260 --> 00:46:37,020
Oh, I am sorry.

720
00:47:10,320 --> 00:47:11,930
Where could he have gone?

721
00:47:12,330 --> 00:47:13,330
Could it be...

722
00:47:14,760 --> 00:47:16,830
He did not go to Milan, did he?

723
00:47:16,900 --> 00:47:17,900
Milan?

724
00:47:17,970 --> 00:47:19,600
Actually, I accidentally heard CEO Ji...

725
00:47:19,600 --> 00:47:21,240
talking on the phone with someone yesterday,

726
00:47:21,300 --> 00:47:24,240
and it sounded like he was asking what time Hee Ju's flight...

727
00:47:24,300 --> 00:47:26,570
to Milan was departing today.

728
00:47:36,150 --> 00:47:38,890
This part goes right here.

729
00:47:39,890 --> 00:47:41,660
I think we need to reinforce it a bit more.

730
00:47:41,720 --> 00:47:44,090
This area here and that side too.

731
00:47:44,160 --> 00:47:45,160
This...

732
00:48:01,410 --> 00:48:02,410
Mi Young.

733
00:48:03,780 --> 00:48:05,050
Yes?

734
00:48:05,110 --> 00:48:06,480
Tomorrow is finally the grand opening.

735
00:48:08,150 --> 00:48:09,380
Yes.

736
00:48:09,420 --> 00:48:10,450
You worked really hard.

737
00:48:11,520 --> 00:48:13,320
Yes, you too.

738
00:48:31,640 --> 00:48:33,810
This is near where you are meeting, right?

739
00:48:33,870 --> 00:48:36,480
Yes. Thanks for the ride.

740
00:48:36,540 --> 00:48:37,640
Do not mention it.

741
00:48:37,710 --> 00:48:41,050
- I will pick you up tomorrow. - Okay.

742
00:48:41,120 --> 00:48:42,780
See you. Good night.

743
00:48:42,850 --> 00:48:43,850
All right.

744
00:49:04,910 --> 00:49:06,210
I think I am losing my mind.

745
00:49:08,710 --> 00:49:11,580
Lately, Won Ho keeps popping into my head.

746
00:49:13,210 --> 00:49:16,680
Even while I am working, I just zone out.

747
00:49:19,390 --> 00:49:22,060
"Where is Won Ho right now? What is he doing?"

748
00:49:23,160 --> 00:49:24,630
That is all I can think about.

749
00:49:26,060 --> 00:49:28,230
Why am I like this, A Ri?

750
00:49:28,300 --> 00:49:31,900
Is that not textbook lovesickness?

751
00:49:32,030 --> 00:49:35,740
- What? - The symptoms are a dead giveaway.

752
00:49:53,490 --> 00:49:55,190
Still, just pick one.

753
00:49:55,620 --> 00:49:56,660
What?

754
00:49:56,660 --> 00:49:59,690
Or should I just order everything on the menu?

755
00:49:59,760 --> 00:50:02,300
No, I will pick something.

756
00:50:03,060 --> 00:50:05,200
I think we need to reinforce this.

757
00:50:05,270 --> 00:50:07,900
Here too, and here, this side...

758
00:50:18,110 --> 00:50:20,410
If it bothers you that much,

759
00:50:20,980 --> 00:50:23,120
why don't you contact him first?

760
00:50:23,420 --> 00:50:27,250
I did think about contacting him,

761
00:50:28,160 --> 00:50:29,720
but I could not.

762
00:50:30,120 --> 00:50:31,690
I felt like he would not answer.

763
00:50:33,360 --> 00:50:34,600
If he really doesn't answer,

764
00:50:35,600 --> 00:50:38,300
I would be so bothered that I could not do anything.

765
00:50:38,370 --> 00:50:41,270
Then I guess you just have to wait until the trial day.

766
00:50:43,570 --> 00:50:48,210
But can you really divorce Won Ho?

767
00:50:49,710 --> 00:50:52,750
You are like this after not seeing Won Ho for just one week.

768
00:50:52,810 --> 00:50:56,020
Later, when you divorce and become complete strangers,

769
00:50:56,080 --> 00:50:57,520
will you be able to endure it?

770
00:50:59,150 --> 00:51:01,120
I did not know I would be like this either.

771
00:51:03,020 --> 00:51:04,260
Won Ho and I...

772
00:51:05,930 --> 00:51:09,400
lived like a show window couple for about three years.

773
00:51:11,160 --> 00:51:14,470
But looking back, we were always together.

774
00:51:15,670 --> 00:51:18,440
Like air, 365 days a year.

775
00:51:20,670 --> 00:51:25,080
Won Ho was always within arm's reach.

776
00:51:27,580 --> 00:51:28,580
But...

777
00:51:30,820 --> 00:51:33,320
now that air is gone.

778
00:51:36,760 --> 00:51:37,760
So...

779
00:51:39,630 --> 00:51:41,560
it is so hard to breathe.

780
00:51:42,860 --> 00:51:43,960
Mi Young.

781
00:51:46,300 --> 00:51:47,300
A Ri.

782
00:51:49,070 --> 00:51:50,240
What do I do?

783
00:51:52,270 --> 00:51:53,840
What am I going to do?

784
00:52:23,170 --> 00:52:25,570
If it bothers you that much,

785
00:52:25,640 --> 00:52:27,870
why don't you contact him first?

786
00:52:34,920 --> 00:52:36,480
(Won Ho...)

787
00:53:01,880 --> 00:53:04,180
Won Ho, are you doing well?

788
00:53:05,280 --> 00:53:06,410
Where are you right now?

789
00:53:36,380 --> 00:53:37,540
It’s finally today.

790
00:53:38,550 --> 00:53:40,210
(Won Ho, are you doing well? Where are you right now?)

791
00:53:45,520 --> 00:53:47,290
- Mi Young. - Yes?

792
00:53:52,390 --> 00:53:53,430
You look...

793
00:53:55,230 --> 00:53:56,300
really pretty today.

794
00:54:16,250 --> 00:54:17,250
What is it?

795
00:54:20,020 --> 00:54:21,590
Come to think of it,

796
00:54:21,660 --> 00:54:23,960
I think I am a really cool guy.

797
00:54:24,020 --> 00:54:25,190
What?

798
00:54:25,790 --> 00:54:28,930
I could just pretend not to know and push forward.

799
00:54:31,200 --> 00:54:32,200
It is just...

800
00:54:33,570 --> 00:54:35,540
I am such a cool guy on the inside too.

801
00:54:36,670 --> 00:54:38,070
So I just cannot do that.

802
00:54:46,910 --> 00:54:47,950
This hand...

803
00:54:49,080 --> 00:54:50,580
I really do not want to let it go.

804
00:54:53,050 --> 00:54:54,050
But...

805
00:54:57,190 --> 00:54:58,430
I will let it go anyway.

806
00:55:00,490 --> 00:55:01,830
I want to let go of this hand...

807
00:55:03,200 --> 00:55:04,360
and see you...

808
00:55:06,130 --> 00:55:07,330
smile again.

809
00:55:08,540 --> 00:55:09,540
Calvin.

810
00:55:17,110 --> 00:55:18,610
Ji Won Ho...

811
00:55:19,150 --> 00:55:20,410
is in Gangwon Province right now.

812
